-- 0215: exclude 111 deposits that reconcile exactly to excluded staged payments.
--
-- Generalization of 0214: every componentless, non-excluded bank deposit was
-- matched against unused excluded staged_payments (all exclusion reasons) for
-- an exact-to-the-cent composition within a ~2-week window. The owner reviewed
-- the full match list (2026-07-23) and ruled these 111 excluded; rows the
-- owner marked "keep" are NOT here. Reason = reason of the largest matched
-- payment; the note carries the full composition evidence.
--
-- Idempotent: deterministic ids + ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING; guarded to skip any
-- deposit that has since gained components or an exclusion.
--
-- Apply after merge, by a human (prod-only data repair; no Publish needed):
--   psql "$PROD_DATABASE_URL" -1 -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 \
--     -f lib/db/migrations/0215_exclude_staged_payment_matched_deposits.sql
--
-- Do not add BEGIN/COMMIT: this file is run with psql -1.

